  "script": "This is Squilliam Fancy Son, declaring an artistic emergency in Indianapolis. On August twenty-third, We The Artists returns with live music, visual art, spoken word, creative vendors, and people who actually understand culture. Even Squidward submitted a piece. Authorities are still deciding whether it qualifies as art. Doors open at five. The declaration runs from six until ten. You must be twenty-one or older. Find us at Bicentennial Plaza at Gainbridge Fieldhouse. Secure your ticket on Eventbrite. See you there, Squiddy. Do leave the clarinet at home.",
